+// Volumetric Explosions: what other mods' resources count as when a part holding them blows up. Change a line,
+// save, and start a new flight.
+//
+// One line a resource: its name, and the stock resource it counts as. The kinds are the ones the mod already
+// knows (see the README): LiquidFuel, Oxidizer, SolidFuel, MonoPropellant, XenonGas (a cold burst), Ore (dust),
+// ElectricCharge (a blue-white flash, counted in units, not kilograms), and three words of this file's own:
+// Hydrogen (fuel that burns with a clear, nearly smokeless flame), Vapour (a cloud, no fire) and None (left out
+// of the reckoning, as Ablator and IntakeAir are).
+//
+// A resource listed here is never guessed at by its name; one not listed still is, as before. Another mod, or a
+// ModuleManager patch, can add to this list or override it with a VOLUMETRIC_EXPLOSIONS_RESOURCES node of its own
+// among the game's configs.
+//
+// These are the resources of the Community Resource Pack (1.4.2), every one of them.
+
